1000+ 972B ~            NumFATs × FATSz32
1001+ 972B ~
1002+ 972B ~            Absolutně:
1003+ 972B ~            FirstDataSectorAbs =
1004+ 972B ~            PartitionStartLBA +
1005+ 972B ~            FirstDataSectorRel
1006+ 972B ~
1007+ 972B ~
1008+ 972B ~            4. Načti Root Directory
1009+ 972B ~            -----------------------
1010+ 972B ~            FAT16
