1072+ 972B ~             ├── Reserved
1073+ 972B ~             ├── FATSize
1074+ 972B ~             ├── RootEntries (FAT16)
1075+ 972B ~             └── RootCluster (FAT32)
1076+ 972B ~             │
1077+ 972B ~             ▼
1078+ 972B ~            FirstDataSectorAbs
1079+ 972B ~             │
1080+ 972B ~             ▼
1081+ 972B ~            Root Directory
1082+ 972B ~             │
1083+ 972B ~             ▼
1084+ 972B ~            Najdi MBD / MBH
1085+ 972B ~             │
1086+ 972B ~             ▼
1087+ 972B ~            FirstCluster
1088+ 972B ~             │
1089+ 972B ~             ▼
1090+ 972B ~            FirstFileLBA
1091+ 972B ~            */
